1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,584
You're trapped in a stone room with two exits.

2
00:00:02,884 --> 00:00:08,662
Through the first is a giant magnifying glass. The sunlight through it will burn you instantly.

3
00:00:08,962 --> 00:00:12,239
The second exit is guarded by a fire-breathing dragon.

4
00:00:12,539 --> 00:00:15,197
How do you escape? You have 10 seconds. Think!

5
00:00:23,997 --> 00:00:25,041
Wait until night!

6
00:00:25,341 --> 00:00:31,129
With no sunlight, the magnifying glass can't burn you. Just walk out through the first exit.

7
00:00:31,429 --> 00:00:34,515
Did you get it right? Follow for a new riddle every day!
